    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:b9ad3e14216c2f08",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "211094ca0b7cb75fba94c34bf5633ab16365e896441c54af5fbd326641f90787",
      "text": "Day 6 · Breakfast and tourist bus to Puno, with stops at Andahuaylillas, whose church is compared to the Sistine Chapel; Raqchi and its Inca temple; lunch in Sicuani; the colourful La Raya pass, with its market against a backdrop of mountains; and Pucará. Arrival in Puno in the evening, after about ten hours on the road, and transfer to the hotel. Optional: the PeruRail Titicaca train instead of the bus (see Optional excursions).\nPeruRail Titicaca train\n+ $ 250 per person\nWednesdays, Fridays and Sundays\nInstead of the bus: lunch with starter, main course and dessert in an elegant dining car, a bar, and a stop at La Raya (4,319 m), the highest point of the route. Arrival in Puno around 19:00.",
